<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Ngô Sĩ Liên</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">15th century</span> · <a href="/centuries/15th-century">15th century</a> · Also known as Ngo Si Lien</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Ngô Sĩ Liên was a Vietnamese historian and official of the Later Lê dynasty. At the command of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/le-thanh-tong">Lê Thánh Tông</a> he compiled the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dai-viet-su-ky-toan-thu">Đại Việt sử ký toàn thư</a>, the complete annals of Đại Việt, completed in 1479, which became the standard history of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vietnam">Vietnam</a> from legendary times to the founding of the Lê.</p></div>
